    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "The primary purpose of this study is to assess the safety and tolerability of TRx0237 when taken at the same time as acetylcholinesterase inhibitors (i.e., donepezil, galantamine, or rivastigmine) and / or memantine to treat patients with mild to moderate Alzheimer's Disease."
    },
    "designModule": {
      "designInfo": {
